# Allowlist: the server image only needs its own projects, their project references and the
# exported levels. Everything else (Client art, references, prototypes, ...) stays out of the
# build context. Keep in sync with the rsync filter in deploy.sh.
*

!Server/
!GameCore/
!FixedPoint/
!static-ecs/
!static-rollback/
!static-rollback-litenetlib/
!Client/maps/*.level.bytes

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.user
